Parts of the note workspace under `frontend/src/notes/` were originally taken
from a third party project under the MIT licence, and a substantial share of
them still is: the editor, the canvas, the graph view and the layout around them
moved over largely as they were. The notice below has to travel with those
parts, and it goes when the last of them has been replaced.

